{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09632","headline":"东归晚次潼关怀古 · 岑参","name":"东归晚次潼关怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春别乡树，晚景低津楼。\n伯夷在首阳，欲往无轻舟。\n遂登关城望，下见洪河流。\n自从巨灵开，流血千万秋。\n行行潘生赋，赫赫曹公谋。\n川上多往事，凄凉满空洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}